---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Research" description="Research interests and selected research experience of Yun-Chen Liu (Alice), including AI-supported mental health and Human-AI Interaction." activePath="/research/">
  <div class="narrow-shell">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Research</p>
      <h1>Questions about people should shape the systems we build.</h1>
      <p class="lead">I study how AI enters human support, learning, and decision-making—and how systems can help without taking over human judgment.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="themes-title">
      <h2 id="themes-title">Research themes</h2>
      <div class="split-list">
        <article class="split-item"><h3>Human-AI collaboration</h3><p>Designing AI as a useful partner while keeping expertise, judgment, and responsibility with people.</p></article>
        <article class="split-item"><h3>Mental health and well-being</h3><p>AI-supported mental health, emotion regulation, chatbot design, and the conditions that make support trustworthy.</p></article>
        <article class="split-item"><h3>Learning and professional practice</h3><p>Exploring how simulations and AI tools can help educators and practitioners prepare for complex human situations.</p></article>
        <article class="split-item"><h3>Social innovation</h3><p>Working with frontline contexts to understand where technology can reduce friction and where human relationships matter most.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="epa-title">
      <h2 id="epa-title">Research experience</h2>
      <h3>NTU EPA Lab</h3>
      <p class="body-copy">Adjunct Research Assistant, Feb 2025 – Aug 2026<br />Research on AI-supported mental health, emotion regulation, Human-Computer Interaction, and chatbot design.</p>
      <div class="research-numbers" aria-label="Research experience measures">
        <div class="research-number"><strong>20+</strong><span>Participants interviewed</span></div>
        <div class="research-number"><strong>~200</strong><span>Conversation transcripts qualitatively coded for emotion-regulation strategies</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="aifr-title">
      <h2 id="aifr-title">NTHU AIFR Lab</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">Adjunct Research Assistant, Feb 2026 – present<br />Leading background research, system design, and development of an <a href="/projects/ai-assisted-case-analysis/">AI-assisted case-analysis tool for practicing psychologists</a>, grounded in clinical supervision practice.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="scholarship-title">
      <h2 id="scholarship-title">Presentations and work in progress</h2>
      <ul class="record-list">
        <li class="record-item">
          <span class="record-kind done">Presented, 2025</span>
          <div><h3>Research findings</h3><p>Presented at the Annual Convention of the Taiwanese Psychological Association.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="record-item">
          <span class="record-kind done">Workshop paper, 2026</span>
          <div><h3>IEEE RO-MAN</h3><p>Workshop paper. Title and public proceedings link to be added when confirmed.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="record-item">
          <span class="record-kind">Work in progress</span>
          <div><h3>Journal manuscript</h3><p>In preparation.</p></div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="now-title">
      <h2 id="now-title">Current research</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">At the Singapore University of Technology and Design, I am exploring avatar-guided and LLM-supported social and cognitive engagement for older adults. This is ongoing work; further details will be shared when they are ready for public release.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
